{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18711","headline":"笼鹰词 · 柳宗元","name":"笼鹰词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凄风淅沥飞严霜，苍鹰上击翻曙光。\n云披雾裂虹蜺断，霹雳掣电捎平冈。\n砉然劲翮翦荆棘，下攫狐兔腾苍茫。\n爪毛吻血百鸟逝，独立四顾时激昂。\n炎风溽暑忽然至，羽翼脱落自摧藏。\n草中狸鼠足爲患，一夕十顾惊且伤。\n但愿清商复爲假，拔去万累云间翔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18711.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18711","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}